  "rationale": "The added columns supply several genuinely distinct, analytically valuable axes (lever, mechanism, specificity, complexity, time horizon, metric alignment) directly relevant to explaining cross-department achievement differences, with little trivial redundancy. Most values are sound readings of the source text. Groundedness is dragged down modestly by scope_breadth's over-assignment to company_wide and measurement_mechanism occasionally inferring from goal type over the stated metric, but reasonable NULL handling and generally faithful extractions keep overall quality high."
